codex
The captures exposed a real nav-state race at the handoff: the nav sometimes remained ink-black over the first dark horizontal frame, making it disappear. I’m consolidating dark/solid nav state into one rAF-throttled scroll calculation so independent ScrollTriggers can’t overwrite each other. The card dot alignment, wipe coverage, sketch crossfade, progress bar, and below-strip copy all look correct.
